stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Staged: edit a rule set
  Staged --> Live: apply
  Live --> Confirmed: confirm within the window
  Live --> RolledBack: window expires
  RolledBack --> Staged: edits are still there
  Confirmed --> [*]

  note right of Live
    New rules are enforcing.
    Open a second connection
    and check before confirming.
  end note

  note right of RolledBack
    Previous rules are back.
    Nothing staged was lost.
  end note
